COMPILATION OF: E48A7

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A7

   1 a 0000 E48A7:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] THE OTHER CONDITION CLASSES, one per statement,
   4 a 0006      all stored into the same bit cell.  `k = 0' is the class
   5 a 0006      [C095] pins as a boolean operand (LXI H / MOV A,M / INX H /
   6 a 0006      ORA M / SUI 01 / SBB A); whether the STA simply appends is
   7 a 0006      UNMEASURED.  `k = 5' has no boolean sample at all. */
   8 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   9 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  10 c 0006   k = 0;
  11 c 000C   b = (k = 0);
  12 c 0018   put list('P=', b);
  13 c 003A   b = (k = 5);
  14 c 0049   put list('Q=', b);
  15 c 006B   stop;
  16 a 006E end E48A7;

CODE SIZE = 006E
DATA AREA = 0007
FREE SYMS = 388B
END  COMPILATION
